      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like the idea behind this,\n\n1. It doesnt affect Content levels so no need to be super trusted\n\n2. They can set automatic Milestones such as (100 Different Avatars) or (1 Approved World)\n\n3. People can actually get something back from VRC for what they're contributing",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
